<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - GETRONICS H1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GETRONICS H1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilderS unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	 0.90  vs   0.63</p>
<p>    Net profit				   79.0   vs  54.5</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			 1.28  vs   1.07</p>
<p>    Operating profit			  107.8   vs  91.4</p>
<p>Note - Computer networks and engineering firm Getronics said in February it believed it could attain annual earnings per share growth of around 20 percent in coming years.  </p>
<p>    Cash flow per share (guilders)	  1.15  vs   0.94</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total (billions)	 1.134  vs  0.981</p>
<p>--Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
